## 4. Selection and sizing

- Bar profile and size, including whether the bar is stepped or has a bolted joint inside the sleeved length.
- End treatment: whether the sleeve has to be sealed or is left open at the plain bar.
- Outdoor or indoor installation, which changes the tracking and UV requirement.
- Whether the assembly will be type tested, since the test will govern the clearance calculation.
- Recovery method available on site, because heavy wall parts need sustained even heat.

